---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import OfferSection from "../components/OfferSection.astro";

/**
 * `/kwiaty-balkonowe/` - the WordPress address, unchanged, so no 301 is needed and the
 * page that ranks for "kwiaty balkonowe Kazimierz Dolny" keeps ranking
 * (docs/przekierowania.md).
 *
 * Since September 2026 it is also where `/rabatowe/` went: the owners had the two groups
 * merged, so this page carries all 34 of them and `/rabatowe/` is a 301 onto it. The
 * argument is in `src/data/offer.ts`.
 *
 * **The description is where "rabatowe i wieloletnie" survives.** The owners chose "Kwiaty
 * balkonowe" as the name of the merged page, which drops a phrase the old site ranked on
 * from the title and the menu; keeping it here costs the page nothing and keeps the words
 * people actually search for in the one field written for them. Both halves of the old
 * descriptions are folded in.
 *
 * `sort="name"` is the other consequence of the merge: 34 entries in editorial `order` is a
 * list nobody can find anything in, so this page alone runs alphabetically, with the letter
 * index and the dividers `OfferSection` draws for it. `/bratki/` and `/chryzantemy/` are
 * short enough to keep saying what the owners consider most important first.
 */
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kwiaty balkonowe"
  description="Kwiaty balkonowe, rabatowe i wieloletnie z własnej uprawy: pelargonie, petunie i surfinie, begonie, fuksje, aksamitki, szałwia, hortensje i funkie. Opis uprawy i dostępne kolory. Gospodarstwo Ogrodnicze „Saran” w Cholewiance pod Kazimierzem Dolnym."
  canonical="/kwiaty-balkonowe/"
  breadcrumb="Kwiaty balkonowe"
>
  <OfferSection
    group="Balkonowe"
    title="Kwiaty balkonowe"
    sort="name"
    note="Poza samymi roślinami sprzedajemy gotowe obsadzone skrzynki, kosze i doniczki - kompozycje można oglądać w zakładce Inspiracje."
  />
</BaseLayout>
